 "paragraphs": [
  {
   "html": "</path></svg></a></div><div class=\"flex justify-center Header_buttonContainer__rN6i5\"><button class=\"pointer-events-auto Header_button__qn2Wj Button_main__NewW7 Button_default__CcbQU\"><span class=\"Button_inner__d7ZPg\">Menu</span></button></div><div class=\"hidden w-[130px] justify-end md:flex\"><a class=\"pointer-events-auto\" aria-label=\"About\" href=\"/about\"></a></div></div></div><main style=\"--theme-primary:16 16 16;--theme-secondary:255 255 255;--theme-tertiary:255 255 255\" class=\"bg-black\"><div style=\"opacity:1\"><div class=\"relative z-main bg-theme-primary transition-bg duration-theme\"><sectio",
   "text": "MenuWhere Opportunity Takes RootTurning a landmark opportunity study into something to be uncoveredVisit SiteFor many Americans, opportunity feels hidden behind barriers hard to navigate. Where Opportunity Takes Root, conducted by Gallup and supported by the Walton Family Foundation, explored the factors that help people access opportunity and thrive. Gladeye&#x27;s challenge was to turn that research into an experience built for discovery, revealing its insights piece by piece."
  },
  {
   "html": "</path></svg></span></span></a></div></h4></div><div class=\"col-span-full space-y-1.5 md:col-span-4\"><h3 class=\"t-p font-semibold\">Category</h3><h4>Storytelling</h4></div><div class=\"col-span-full space-y-1.5 md:col-span-4\"><h3 class=\"t-p font-semibold\">Date</h3><h4>2026</h4></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-theme=\"light\" class=\"text-theme-secondary transition-colors duration-theme\"><div class=\"WrokBloks_main__IqYqU\"><div class=\"ui-grid mx-auto my-sgs max-w-site gap-y-sgs\"><div class=\"relative col-span-full aspect-[1680/970]\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none relative h-full ",
   "text": "CategoryStorytellingDate2026Opportunity is uncoveredRather than presenting the report as a static collection of findings, we designed an experience where insights emerge progressively through interaction. Layers reveal themselves over time, data unfolds and connections become visible, each interaction uncovering another piece of a larger story."
  },
  {
   "html": "As users move through the report, individual findings begin to connect, building a richer understanding of the conditions that help young people access opportunity. In this way the experience mirrors the research itself: looking deeper reveals insights that might otherwise remain hidden. This principle informed every decision that followed, from navigation and motion through to storytelling and visual design.",
   "text": "As users move through the report, individual findings begin to connect, building a richer understanding of the conditions that help young people access opportunity. In this way the experience mirrors the research itself: looking deeper reveals insights that might otherwise remain hidden. This principle informed every decision that followed, from navigation and motion through to storytelling and visual design."
  },
  {
   "html": "Motion became a primary storytelling tool throughout the experience, with content revealed through a system of progressive disclosure that lets audiences explore findings at their own pace. Rather than relying on conventional report structures, information is introduced through interaction, creating moments of curiosity, engagement, and surprise.",
   "text": "Motion became a primary storytelling tool throughout the experience, with content revealed through a system of progressive disclosure that lets audiences explore findings at their own pace. Rather than relying on conventional report structures, information is introduced through interaction, creating moments of curiosity, engagement, and surprise."
  },
  {
   "html": "Throughout the site, motion, interaction, and content work together to transform reading into exploration. By turning a traditional report into an interactive experience, the project encourages deeper engagement with the findings and builds stronger connections between audiences and the research, inviting participation in the process of discovery rather than simply presenting evidence.",
   "text": "Throughout the site, motion, interaction, and content work together to transform reading into exploration. By turning a traditional report into an interactive experience, the project encourages deeper engagement with the findings and builds stronger connections between audiences and the research, inviting participation in the process of discovery rather than simply presenting evidence."
  },
  {
   "html": "The result is a digital experience that feels uniquely aligned with its subject matter, where the act of uncovering insights becomes a reflection of uncovering opportunity itself.",
   "text": "The result is a digital experience that feels uniquely aligned with its subject matter, where the act of uncovering insights becomes a reflection of uncovering opportunity itself."
  },
